      "description": "The cold-start file for an agent working IN this layer, and it is THIS LAYER'S own as of 2026-09-20 (issue #592). It was declared `scope: \"repository\"`, so it resolved to the repository root's AGENTS.md — one file answering both \"what binds everywhere\" and \"what binds in the harness layer\", which is the conflation `readmeFinding` calls MAJOR for a non-root instance and could not report, because the asset DID resolve. It resolved to the wrong file's job. No `source`: this file is authored here. The root's carries the bootstrap provenance, because the root's is the file bootstrap copies at initialisation.",
